#: ../../en/introduction.md:7
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:10
msgid "Comfy Research"
msgstr "Comfy Research"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:13
msgid ""
"Compose an experiment as a node graph. Run it, inspect how learning "
"changes, and keep the complete experimental structure reproducible."
msgstr "将实验组织为 Node 图。运行实验、观察学习如何变化，并让完整的实验结构保持可复现。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:19
msgid "Start on CPU · 10–15 min"
msgstr "[在 CPU 上开始 · 10–15 分钟](get-started/index.md)"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:26
msgid "Already installed? Run the first graph"
msgstr "[已经安装？运行第一个图](get-started/first-graph.md)"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:34
msgid "Try online ↗"
msgstr "[在线体验 ↗](https://online.comfy-research.com/)"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:34
msgid ""
"Comfy Research is a local visual environment for AI/ML research. A graph "
"connects the parts of an experiment: data, model, objective, optimizer, "
"and training procedure, with Observables that measure what happens during"
" learning."
msgstr ""
"Comfy Research 是面向 AI/ML "
"研究的本地可视化环境。一张图连接实验的各个部分：数据、模型、目标、优化器和训练过程，以及用于测量学习过程的 Observables。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:38
msgid ""
"The graph is more than a picture. It is the experiment specification sent"
" to the backend: node settings become parameters, edges determine "
"dependencies, and the Trainer validates the connected graph before "
"starting a run."
msgstr "图不只是图片。它是发送到后端的实验规格：Node 设置会成为参数，边决定依赖关系，Trainer 会在运行开始前验证已连接的图。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid ""
"Comfy Research workbench showing a project, a connected training graph, "
"Trainer controls, and an Observable result."
msgstr "Comfy Research 工作台，展示项目、已连接的训练图、Trainer 控件和 Observable 结果。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:46
msgid ""
"One graph keeps the experiment structure, execution controls, "
"measurements, and recorded result visible in the same workbench."
msgstr "一张图在同一工作台中同时呈现实验结构、执行控件、测量和已记录结果。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:50
msgid "Why experiments are graphs"
msgstr "为什么实验要用图来表达"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:52
msgid "Research code usually mixes three different concerns in one script:"
msgstr "研究代码通常会在一个脚本中混合三类关注点："

#: ../../en/introduction.md:54
msgid "**What is being trained**: the dataset, model, loss, and optimizer."
msgstr "**训练什么**：数据集、模型、损失和优化器。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:55
msgid ""
"**How it is being measured**: loss curves, accuracy, norms, spectra, or "
"representations."
msgstr "**如何测量**：损失曲线、准确率、范数、谱或表征。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:57
msgid ""
"**What must be retained**: configuration, results, checkpoints, and the "
"relationship between them."
msgstr "**必须保留什么**：配置、结果、检查点以及它们之间的关系。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:60
msgid ""
"Comfy Research keeps those concerns visible and composable. Changing a "
"model or attaching a new measurement becomes a graph edit rather than a "
"rewrite of the whole training script."
msgstr "Comfy Research 让这些关注点保持可见且可组合。更换模型或添加新的测量变成一次图编辑，而不必重写整个训练脚本。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:64
msgid "The product model"
msgstr "产品模型"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:66
msgid "Every standard training graph has the same center of gravity:"
msgstr "每张标准训练图都围绕同一个核心组织："

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Part"
msgstr "组成部分"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Dataset"
msgstr "Dataset"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Produces the train and optional test data."
msgstr "生成训练数据及可选的测试数据。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Defines the trainable computation."
msgstr "定义可训练计算。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Loss"
msgstr "Loss"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Defines the primary optimization objective."
msgstr "定义主要优化目标。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Optimizer"
msgstr "Optimizer"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Updates model parameters; schedules can be connected separately."
msgstr "更新模型参数；调度器可单独连接。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Trainer"
msgstr "Trainer"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Validates the graph, runs training, and streams progress and results."
msgstr "验证图、执行训练，并流式输出进度和结果。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Observable"
msgstr "Observable"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid ""
"Reads training state at log steps without changing the optimization "
"objective."
msgstr "在记录步读取训练状态，不改变正在优化的目标。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Visualization"
msgstr "可视化"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:42
msgid "Displays loss or Observable histories produced by the Trainer."
msgstr "显示 Trainer 生成的损失或 Observable 历史。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:78
msgid ""
"This separation matters experimentally. An Observable can be added to "
"inspect a hypothesis without silently changing the loss being optimized."
msgstr "这种分离对实验很重要。可以添加 Observable 来检查假设，而不会悄然改变正在优化的损失。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:81
msgid "From question to reproducible artifact"
msgstr "从问题到可复现实验产物"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:83
msgid "A normal workflow is:"
msgstr "典型工作流如下："

#: ../../en/introduction.md:85
msgid "Start from a small graph or a bundled template."
msgstr "从一张小图或随附模板开始。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:86
msgid "Change one controlled part of the experiment."
msgstr "修改实验中的一个受控部分。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:87
msgid "Run locally on CPU, MPS, or CUDA, or use the configured remote GPU path."
msgstr "在本地 CPU、MPS 或 CUDA 上运行，或使用已配置的远程 GPU 路径。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:88
msgid "Read the Trainer and Observable outputs."
msgstr "查看 Trainer 和 Observable 输出。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:89
msgid "Save the graph at the level needed for reproduction."
msgstr "按复现所需层级保存图。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:91
msgid "Comfy Research supports reusable **Templates** as starting points."
msgstr "Comfy Research 支持将可复用的 **Templates** 作为起点。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:93
msgid ""
"Graph files and library entries can be saved as structure only, with "
"plots, or with model checkpoint data. The [User Guide](user-"
"guide/index.md) explains the trade-offs."
msgstr "图文件和库条目可以仅保存结构，也可以包含绘图或模型检查点数据。[用户指南](user-guide/index.md)说明了其中的权衡。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:97
msgid "Documentation scope"
msgstr "文档范围"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:99
msgid ""
"This documentation covers the stable research path in the current source "
"tree: the canvas, node graph, Trainer, Observables, saved graphs, and the"
" in-repository Node extension system. Experimental product areas are "
"intentionally outside this first documentation release."
msgstr ""
"本文档覆盖当前源代码树中的稳定研究路径：画布、Node 图、Trainer、Observables、已保存图以及仓库内的 Node "
"扩展系统。实验性产品领域有意不纳入首个文档版本。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:109
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:113
msgid "Build from source, open the canvas, and complete a CPU training run."
msgstr "从源码构建，打开画布并完成一次 CPU 训练运行。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:116
msgid "User Guide"
msgstr "用户指南"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:120
msgid ""
"Understand graph wiring, runs, Observables, persistence, and "
"reproducibility."
msgstr "了解图连线、运行、Observables、持久化和可复现性。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:123
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:127
msgid "Reproductions of classic learning-mechanics and physics-of-AI phenomena."
msgstr "复现经典学习机制和 AI 物理学现象。"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:130
msgid "Extend"
msgstr "扩展"

#: ../../en/introduction.md:134
msgid "Define and register custom Nodes and Observables in the repository."
msgstr "在仓库中定义并注册自定义 Nodes 和 Observables。"
